      "value": "For those who’ve never heard of this (such as myself), I BELIEVE this is referring to a Unity port of the Mastodon API, which is a free, open source social networking architecture. This would in theory enable social networking features in VRChat. See here: https://github.com/tootsuite/mastodon",
